# Torre de los Recuerdos, 3F (C4b, contract 41), 14 x 12, interior. Wild ghosts (the ghost-dust boards `oplank_d_xx` are the grass of the tower: wispsheet common, shroudle rare, hatchkip) and three mediums.
# Without the Lente Espectral the wild ones are the unidentified GHOSTS of contract 36.4. THE MOTHER GHOST blocks the stairs up (top right): the step trigger (11,3) in the one-cell corridor in front of the door runs `ghost_stairs` until she
# rests (flag 807): without the Lente an unidentified ghost battle (you can only run: you are pushed back); with it a TRAINER fight against her spirit (Shellbrute 30, a trainer's creature cannot be caught).
@map torre_3
@size 14 12
@interior yes
@fog yes
@ghosts yes
@area torre_recuerdos
@bg 3
@fill oplank_00
@spawn down 2 3 S
@spawn up 11 4 N
@flag ghost_rested 807
@encounters grass rate=11
  wispsheet 21 25 55
  hatchkip 21 24 30
  shroudle 24 26 15
@end
@legend
  .  tile=oplank_00
  a  tile=none object=wall_corner
  b  tile=none object=wall_j
  c  tile=none object=wall_win_j
  d  tile=none object=wall_i
  e  tile=oplank_11
  f  tile=oplank_01 object=escalator
  g  tile=oplank_01
  h  tile=oplank_11 object=escalator
  i  tile=oplank_10
  j  tile=oplank_00 door=escalator
  k  tile=oplank_00 object=pillar
  l  tile=oplank_10 door=escalator
  m  tile=oplank_11 item=rich_salve
  n  tile=oplank_11 object=stele_a interact=look text=torre.stele.d
  o  tile=oplank_01 object=candle
  p  tile=oplank_01 object=pillar
  q  tile=oplank_11 interact=step script=ghost_stairs
  r  tile=none object=wall_win_i
  s  tile=oplank_d_10
  t  tile=oplank_d_00
  u  tile=oplank_10 object=stele_b
  v  tile=oplank_d_11
  w  tile=oplank_d_01
  x  tile=oplank_11 object=stele_a
  y  tile=oplank_00 object=stele_a
  z  tile=oplank_10 npc=medium id=m1 face=E trainer=medium_t3a range=3 text=tr.medium_t3a.pre after=tr.medium_t3a.after
  A  tile=oplank_00 npc=medium id=m2 face=N trainer=medium_t3b range=3 text=tr.medium_t3b.pre after=tr.medium_t3b.after
  B  tile=oplank_01 object=stele_b
  C  tile=oplank_00 object=candle
  D  tile=oplank_00 npc=medium id=m3 face=E trainer=medium_t3c range=3 text=tr.medium_t3c.pre after=tr.medium_t3c.after
  E  tile=oplank_10 item=crystal_plus
@grid
  abbbcbbbcbbbcb
  defegegegeghge
  diji.i.i.iklki
  dmgegnoegepqpe
  ri.sti.sti.i.u
  degvwegvgxgege
  diyi.z.i.i.sti
  degegewvoegvoe
  ri.i.its.iAi.i
  dxgvwxgegvweBe
  diCs.i.iDsti.E
  degegegegegege
@warp j -> torre_2 spawn=up
@warp l -> torre_4 spawn=down
# The mother ghost.
# Without the Lente: an unidentified ghost (wild_go on a ghost map, contract 36.4: nothing can be done, only run) and the hero is pushed back. With the Lente: her spirit fights as a trainer (it cannot be caught); a win: she rests.
@script ghost_stairs step if !ghost_rested
    has_item lente 4
    jv 4 1 seen
    say torre.ghost.chill
    say torre.ghost.chill2
    wild shellbrute 30 5
    say torre.ghost.back
    hero_walk SW 2
    end
  seen:
    say torre.ghost.seen
    say torre.ghost.seen2
    battle 96 0
    jv 0 1 won
    blackout
    end
  won:
    say torre.ghost.rest
    say torre.ghost.rest2
    setf ghost_rested
    say torre.ghost.rest3
@end
